<title>SWEDEN: SWIMMING-WORLD SHORT-COURSE CHAMPIONSHIPS PROGRAMME.</title>
<headline>SWIMMING-WORLD SHORT-COURSE CHAMPIONSHIPS PROGRAMME.</headline>
<dateline>GOTHENBURG, Sweden 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Programme of the</p>
<p>third world short-course swimming championships (times GMT):</p>
<p>Thursday, April 17 (heats start 0700, finals 1700):</p>
<p>Men's 100 metres butterfly</p>
<p>Women's 200 butterfly</p>
<p>Men's 200 freestyle</p>
<p>Women's 100 freestyle</p>
<p>Men's 400 individual medley</p>
<p>Women's 400 individual medley</p>
<p>Men's 4x100 medley relay</p>
<p>Women's 4x200 freestyle relay</p>
<p>Friday, April 18 (heats 0700, finals 1600):</p>
<p>Women's 50 freestyle</p>
<p>Men's 100 breaststroke</p>
<p>Women's 200 breaststroke</p>
<p>Men's 400 freestyle</p>
<p>Women's 200 freestyle</p>
<p>Men's 200 backstroke</p>
<p>Women's 100 backstroke</p>
<p>Men's 4x200 freestyle relay</p>
<p>Women's 800 freestyle</p>
<p>Saturday, April 19 (heats 0700, finals 1600):</p>
<p>Women's 100 butterfly</p>
<p>Men's 200 butterfly</p>
<p>Women's 400 freestyle</p>
<p>Men's 100 freestyle</p>
<p>Women's 100 breaststroke</p>
<p>Men's 200 breaststroke</p>
<p>Women's 4x100 freestyle relay</p>
<p>Sunday, April 20 (heats 0700, finals 1600):</p>
<p>Men's 50 freestyle</p>
<p>Women's 200 individual medley</p>
<p>Men's 200 individual medley</p>
<p>Women's 200 backstroke</p>
<p>Men's 100 backstroke</p>
<p>Women's 4x100 medley relay</p>
<p>Men's 4x100 freestyle relay</p>
<p>Men's 1,500 freestyle.</p>
<p>Note: There will be no eliminatory heats in the women's 800</p>
<p>freestyle and men's 1,500 freestyle. The eight fastest-seeded</p>
<p>swimmers will compete in the evening and the rest in the morning</p>
<p>in these two events; times will determine overall final</p>
<p>placings.</p>
</text>
